      "content": "i don't want to \"rest\" for a moment. i want the rest to be permanent. i mean, i'm already a ghost in my own house. what's the point of fighting so hard just to keep this cycle going? everyone depends on me so much, but they don't even see me. they just see what i can do for them. wouldn't it be easier if i just... stopped? if i just wasn't part of the equation anymore? it feels like the only way to actually have control over anything is to just walk away from it all.",
